  <button class=\"p-1.5 border border-amber-500 text-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-500 hover:text-white rounded-sm transition-all\" data-kid=\"79\"><i class=\"bx bx-edit\" data-kid=\"80\"></i></button>\n                <button class=\"p-1.5 border border-red-500 text-red-500 hover:bg-red-500 hover:text-white rounded-sm transition-all\" data-kid=\"81\"><i class=\"bx bx-trash\" data-kid=\"82\"></i></button>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  \n  <div class=\"card-dark rounded-sm shadow-lg overflow-hidden border-t-4 border-[var(--invilara-azul)]\" data-kid=\"83\">\n    <div class=\"bg-[var(--invilara-azul)] p-4 text-white font-bold flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"84\">\n      <i class=\"bx bx-file-blank\" data-kid=\"85\"></i> Registrar Informe de Avance de Obra\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"p-6\" data-kid=\"86\">\n      <form class=\"space-y-6\" data-kid=\"87\">\n        \n        <div data-kid=\"88\">\n          <h6 class=\"text-sm font-semibold border-b border-[var(--dark-border)] pb-2 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"89\">\n            <i class=\"bx bx-info-circle\" data-kid=\"90\"></i> Información Básica\n          </h6>\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\" data-kid=\"91\">\n            <div data-kid=\"92\">\n              <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold mb-2\" data-kid=\"93\">Tipo de Informe <span class=\"text-red-500\" data-kid=\"94\">*</span></label>\n              <select class=\"input-dark w-full p-2.5 rounded-md text-sm outline-hidden focus:border-[var(--invilara-verde)]\" data-kid=\"95\">\n                <option selected disabled data-kid=\"96\">Seleccione el tipo...</option>\n                <option data-kid=\"97\">Ficha Inspección Técnica</option>\n                <option data-kid=\"98\">Menor</option>\n                <option data-kid=\"99\">Mayor</option>\n                <option data-kid=\"100\">Avance Mensual</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"101\">\n              <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold mb-2\" data-kid=\"102\">Estado de la Obra <span class=\"text-red-500\" data-kid=\"103\">*</span></label>\n              <select class=\"input-dark w-full p-2.5 rounded-md text-sm outline-hidden focus:border-[var(--invilara-verde)]\" data-kid=\"104\">\n                <option selected disabled data-kid=\"105\">Seleccione el estado...</option>\n                <option data-kid=\"106\">Aprobado</option>\n                <option data-kid=\"107\">En Ejecución</option>\n                <option data-kid=\"108\">Culminado</option>\n                <option data-kid=\"109\">Paralizado</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4\" data-kid=\"110\">\n          <div class=\"md:col-span-2\" data-kid=\"111\">\n            <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold mb-2\" data-kid=\"112\">Población Beneficiada <span class=\"text-red-500\" data-kid=\"113\">*</span></label>\n            <input type=\"text\" class=\"input-dark w-full p-2.5 rounded-md text-sm outline-hidden focus:border-[var(--invilara-verde)]\" placeholder=\"Ej: Comunidad La Salle (500 familias)\" data-kid=\"114\">\n          </div>\n          <div data-kid=\"115\">\n            <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold mb-2\" data-kid=\"116\">% de Avance</label>\n            <div class=\"flex\" data-kid=\"117\">\n              <input type=\"number\" class=\"input-dark flex-1 p-2.5 rounded-l-md text-sm outline-hidden focus:border-[var(--invilara-verde)]\" value=\"0\" data-kid=\"118\">\n              <span class=\"input-dark border-l-0 p-2.5 rounded-r-md text-sm font-bold\" data-kid=\"119\">%</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div data-kid=\"120\">\n          <h6 class=\"text-sm font-semibold border-b border-[var(--dark-border)] pb-2 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"121\">\n            <i class=\"bx bx-user\" data-kid=\"122\"></i> Responsable\n          </h6>\n          <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold mb-2\" data-kid=\"123\">Gerente o Inspector Responsable <span class=\"text-red-500\" data-kid=\"124\">*</span></label>\n          <select class=\"input-dark w-full p-2.5 rounded-md text-sm outline-hidden focus:border-[var(--invilara-verde)]\" data-kid=\"125\">\n            <option selected disabled data-kid=\"126\">Seleccione el responsable...</option>\n            <option data-kid=\"127\">Ing. Ricardo Pérez - Gerente de Obras</option>\n            <option data-kid=\"128\">Lic. María García - Inspectora Jefe</option>\n          </select>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div data-kid=\"129\">\n          <h6 class=\"text-sm font-semibold border-b border-[var(--dark-border)] pb-2 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"130\">\n            <i class=\"bx bx-edit\" data-kid=\"131\"></i> Observaciones Técnicas\n          </h6>\n          <textarea class=\"input-dark w-full p-3 rounded-md text-sm outline-hidden focus:border-[var(--invilara-verde)] min-h-[100px]\" placeholder=\"Describa las observaciones técnicas, incidencias, recomendaciones...\" data-kid=\"132\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"pt-6 border-t border-[var(--dark-border)] text-center\" data-kid=\"133\">\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"bg-[var(--invilara-verde)] hover:bg-[var(--invilara-verde-claro)] text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-lg hover:shadow-green-900/40\" data-kid=\"134\">\n            <i class=\"bx bx-save mr-1\" data-kid=\"135\"></i> Registrar Informe\n          </button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"ml-4 border border-[var(--dark-border)] hover:bg-[var(--dark-border)] text-[var(--dark-text)] px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold text-sm transition-all\" data-kid=\"136\">\n            <i class=\"bx bx-x mr-1\" data-kid=\"137\"></i> Cancelar\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
